5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Since we are all here, let us find a fair way to handle our bills. I suggest we look into the sunlight and heating need by room and winter habits at a house paying ahead.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,I agree we need a fair system. I'd like to look into the payment log for the last twelve months and the kitchen notice about the cooler to see how we've been getting along.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,"I want to know if some people are paying more than others, so I will check the plug-in monitor readings room by room and the settling up when the last rooms filled.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I think we need to be practical about the costs. I'll look into the electrician's quote for the rooms and the last twelve utility statements to see what we're actually dealing with.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I want to know how much work it is to manage. I'll look into the monthly settle observed at another house and the trial run of a reconciliation template.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It seems we have a comprehensive plan. Does anyone feel we are missing a perspective, or are we satisfied with these choices for now?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,I think we've covered the main points. I'm just hoping we can find a way to make this process feel less stressful for everyone involved.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,I agree with Midori. I just want us to be honest with each other so that nobody feels like they are being treated unfairly.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"Honesty is great, Minato, but let's not forget the bottom line. I'm curious to see if our current habits are just expensive or if the system itself is the problem.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I just hope we can find a way that doesn't make anyone feel overwhelmed by the paperwork.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,"That is a valid concern, Daisuke. Balance is key to a peaceful home. Shall we proceed with our research and then share our findings?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,"Yes, let's do that. I think it's best if we each take some time to look into our chosen topics and then come back together to discuss.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I'll do that. I'm looking forward to seeing what we find out so we can all feel better about how things are split.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,Sounds like a plan. I'll get to it right away; I'm eager to see if those monthly spikes are as bad as I suspect.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll do my best to look into the templates and the other house's process. I'll see you all soon.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,Let us conclude this first stage then. I shall step away to reflect on the heating needs and the habits of others. We shall meet again shortly.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Midori,,I will go and check the logs and the kitchen notice now. I hope we can find a solution that brings us all closer together.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minato,,I'll go check the monitor readings and the records from when the house filled up. See you all later!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,I'm off to crunch some numbers and see what the electrician says. Let's hope the results aren't too shocking!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll go look into the settle process and the template now. I'll see you all in a bit.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
