35,2,1,talk,Servas,,"I have learned that some rooms are naturally colder than others, and that a fixed seasonal rate can lead to a very relaxed atmosphere regarding energy use.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,"I found that our payment logs show several late payments after disputes, and some people even avoided using the cooler in summer to avoid arguments.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,"My research showed that energy use varies wildly between rooms, and it took us a long time to agree on what the new residents owed when they first moved in.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"The bills fluctuate wildly every month, and fitting individual meters would be quite an investment—about 34,000 yen per room plus annual maintenance.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I found that managing individual readings takes a lot of time, and using a reconciliation template for the whole year is quite a tedious process.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"It seems we are all facing different burdens. @Midori, it is saddening to hear that the fear of conflict has led some to suffer in the heat.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"It really is. It shows that our current way of splitting things is affecting our happiness and how we treat each other, not just our wallets.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"If the energy use is so different between rooms, like I found, then it's no wonder people are arguing. It doesn't feel fair to split it equally.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"Exactly. But if we go for individual meters to solve that fairness issue, we're looking at a huge upfront cost and ongoing fees. Is that really worth it?","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I'm worried that if we choose a system that requires a lot of manual work, it will just create more stress for whoever has to manage it.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,"We must consider if the peace of mind is worth the price. If we avoid the cost of meters, can we find a way to ensure no one sits in the cold?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,"I think we need a system that removes the feeling of accusation. If we can stop the monthly disputes, the atmosphere in the house will improve significantly.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,"I agree. If we can find a way to make it fair without it being a fight every month, then everyone will be much happier living here.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"I'm all for happiness, but we can't ignore that the bills are unpredictable. We need something that stops those massive monthly spikes from hitting us like a ton of bricks.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I agree with May. If the bills change so much every month, it makes the paperwork even harder and more stressful to handle.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,"It seems we are in agreement that the current system is unsustainable. We need a solution that balances fairness, financial predictability, and ease of management.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Midori,,I hope we can choose something that prioritizes our harmony. It would be wonderful to stop worrying about who owes what and just enjoy each other's company.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,"I just want a system where we don't have to guess if someone is being unfair. If we can find a way to be honest about the costs, I'll be happy.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,I'm ready to see the options. Let's hope there's a way to smooth out those costs without spending a fortune on equipment or spending our lives doing math.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I just want something simple. I'm ready to see the options and hope we can find a way that doesn't take up all our free time.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
