60,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Now that we have the options—Per-Room Metering, a Seasonal Fixed Rate, or a Flat Household Share—I believe the Seasonal Fixed Rate would best preserve our peace and warmth.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Servas. A Seasonal Fixed Rate would stop the monthly arguments and the feeling of accusation, allowing us to focus on our harmony instead of the bills.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Minato,,"I'm torn. Per-Room Metering seems the most fair since usage varies so much, but the cost May mentioned is high. Maybe a Flat Household Share is simpler?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,May,,A Flat Household Share is too risky; it doesn't solve the monthly spikes. I prefer the Seasonal Fixed Rate because it makes the costs predictable for all of us.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I agree with the Seasonal Fixed Rate. It sounds much simpler to manage than the other options, and it would save us from the tedious monthly calculations.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Servas,,"It is heartening to see such a consensus. By agreeing on a seasonal rate, we ensure that no one feels the need to suffer in silence to save a few yen.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Midori,,"Exactly. It removes the tension from our daily interactions. If we know the cost in advance, we can stop treating each other like debtors and start acting like a family again.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Minato,,"If everyone else is so sure about the Seasonal Fixed Rate, I'll go with that too. I just want us to stop arguing and feel good about living together.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,May,,It's a relief we're on the same page. Predictability is exactly what I need to stop those winter bills from feeling like a second rent.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,I'm glad we're all in agreement. It sounds like the most sustainable choice for everyone's mental health and my own free time.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Servas,,"Since we have found a path that satisfies our need for warmth, harmony, and simplicity, I believe we are ready to make it official.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Midori,,I am happy to support this. Let's move forward with the Seasonal Fixed Rate so we can put these tensions behind us.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Minato,,I'll vote for the Seasonal Fixed Rate too. I'm glad we found a way to make everyone feel comfortable and fair.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,May,,I'm in. Seasonal Fixed Rate it is; it's the only way to keep my budget from crashing every winter.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll vote for the Seasonal Fixed Rate as well. It's definitely the best way to keep things simple and stress-free for everyone.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Servas,,Then let us cast our votes. I vote for the Seasonal Fixed Rate.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Midori,,I vote for the Seasonal Fixed Rate.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
